# WORKAROUND (MAINLINE-LOG 2026-10-04): the GMU does not come back after GPU
# runtime suspend ("Timeout waiting for GMU OOB set GPU_SET" -> hangcheck),
# even with the upstream GMU fixes backported. Keep GPU and GMU powered.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="platform", KERNEL=="3d00000.gpu", ATTR{power/control}="on"
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="platform", KERNEL=="3d6a000.gmu", ATTR{power/control}="on"
